cajole (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Patch the bundled dconf to honor DCONF_USER_CONFIG_DIR so Cajole reads
    the host's real automatic brightness setting. Previously the read
    returned nothing, so the setting was restored to its default (on) even
    if the user had it off.

 -- AJ Dunevent <aj@dunevent.net>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

cajole (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pause automatic brightness during an alarm by changing the real
    setting: build the dconf GIO module into the Flatpak and select it with
    GSETTINGS_BACKEND.
  * Restore automatic brightness at startup if an earlier run was killed
    while it was paused.

 -- AJ Dunevent <aj@dunevent.net>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

